; THE DROWNED (2026-07-23, THE HOLLOW BELOW): a miner claimed by the flood
; long before the Overseer's seal ever broke. Slower and tankier than a
; Grunt up top — the current down here does half the work for it — but it
; hits harder once it has you. Reuses the Grunt's silhouette on purpose:
; content-as-data, and the Hollow Below is a recolour+atmosphere pass on the
; existing pipeline, same precedent as the three surface zones.

